  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients and adjust pH to 6.8 with NaOH. Distribute the solution into culture vessels (leaving more than 80% volume of gas phase in the vessel) under a stream of a N2--CO2 (80:20, v/v) gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. Then, add the following solutions (filter--sterilized) to the medium (per liter):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Finally, replace the gas phase with a N2--CO2--O2 (79:20:1, by volume) gas mixture and pressurize to 200 kPa with the same gas mixture."
    }
  ]
}